  "contract": "The public KvEngine committed-batch API preflights the complete mutation set against unchanged state before publishing any value, tombstone or change event. Stale versions, changed values at the same version and conflicting same-key mutations reject atomically. Exact same-version replay and identical duplicate mutations do not duplicate history or change events. Empty batches remain no-ops.",
